OL,3,ADrugs at their fingertips, intense
OL,4,Apressure: Why child stars fall into
OL,5,Aaddiction
OL,6,
OL,7,FHayden Panettiere was 16 when drugs
OL,8,Ffirst arrived in her life in Hollywood.
OL,10,FAhead of a red carpet event for the hit
OL,11,Fseries Heroes, she has said someone on
OL,12,Fher team handed her a pill to help amp
OL,13,Fup her energy. The hit sci-fi NBC
OL,14,Fseries had catapulted the teen into a
OL,15,Fhousehold name - and that brought with
OL,16,Fit intense pressure and exhaustion she
OL,17,Fsays felt overwhelming.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,164,160,200,105,0,100
PN,11915
SC,0015
CT,25,T
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1787519935
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ADrugs at their fingertips, intense
OL,4,Apressure: Why child stars fall into
OL,5,Aaddiction
OL,6,
OL,7,F"Within minutes, a wave of energy
OL,8,Fwashed over me, like I'd just woken up
OL,9,Ffrom the most refreshing night's sleep
OL,10,Fof my life," Panettiere wrote about
OL,11,Fthat pill in her memoir, which was
OL,12,Freleased just months before her death.
OL,14,FShe called it "the gateway drug that
OL,15,Fushered me toward the good of
OL,16,Fpharmaceuticals and the downfall of
OL,17,Faddiction".
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
